file f`https://storage.googleapis.com/trilogy_public_models/duckdb/trees/aumel_tree_predictions_v{data_version}.parquet`:f`gcs://trilogy_public_models/duckdb/trees/aumel_tree_predictions_v{data_version}.parquet`
